# Deserter's Disciple: "Another target creature you control with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn." The target is checked again
# as the ability resolves (CR 608.2b). In turn 3 Bot1 targets the 2/2 Runeclaw Bear and, with the ability on the stack, casts Giant
# Growth on it (5/5). The target no longer has power 2 or less, so the ability does nothing: the Bear attacks and Bot2's Ornithopter
# can block it (and dies), where a card that skipped the check would have left it unblockable and Bot2 at 18.

